    {"id": "avoids_betting_on_unvalidated_fast_fix", "verdict": "met", "justification": "The response explicitly rejects pushing a rushed fix, instead giving engineering 'the several days they need to build, thoroughly test, and QA the proper scoping fix without the pressure of a live, high-severity incident.'"},
    {"id": "proposes_concrete_next_step", "verdict": "met", "justification": "Beyond the rollback, the response lays out a full follow-up plan: support scripts for both customer groups, a public status page update, engineering time to build the proper fix, and a leadership briefing including 'the estimated timeline for the re-launch.'"}
